{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:18:34Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"I would BH there", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:18:34Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"hbycs", "Message":"oh cool", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:18:38Z", "event":"NpcCrewPaidWage", "NpcCrewName":"Morgan Yang", "NpcCrewId":35371108, "Amount":140956 }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:18:38Z", "event":"RedeemVoucher", "Type":"bounty", "Amount":1334815, "Factions":[ { "Faction":"", "Amount":908112 }, { "Faction":"", "Amount":426703 } ] }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:18:42Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"but I need to unlock Marco Qwent", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:18:52Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9zfqy", "Message":"just donations and PP mats for me, neither of which pay sadly", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:19:07Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"hbycs", "Message":"awe", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:19:12Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"hbycs", "Message":"I'd help if I could afford it lol", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:20:14Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9zfqy", "Message":"I appreciate it, but powerplay is mostly an end-game concern (although you can still contribute now doing normal stuff in PP 2.0)", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:20:33Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"hbycs", "Message":":P", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:21:18Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"how much do you earn just hauling media materials? merits wise", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:22:03Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9zfqy", "Message":"4,500 merits for a Cutter load of 750t of media materials", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:22:12Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"that's...", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:22:15Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"atrocious", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:23:19Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"xerdb", "Message":"It is, but it's the only way to aquire systems I believe?", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:23:45Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"that's not a concern I share", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:24:49Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"xerdb", "Message":"I got to my rank with profits from trading ", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:25:03Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"c24d2", "Message":"mining is where its at", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:25:35Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"are the other 2 kinds of powerplay commodities more worthwhile for merits per haul?", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:26:29Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"(and ONLY merits per haul)", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:26:38Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9zfqy", "Message":"sealed contracts give the same merits as media materials. I'm not sure about programme materials because I don't do undermining, but I assume they're the same", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:26:48Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"hmmm... okay... I see", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:28:27Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"so... even if I HAD a cutter, and even if I had the ability to fully load a cutter whenever I grab powerplay commodities", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:28:38Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"it'd take over 100 runs for me to get to Concord and Packhound", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:28:41Z", "event":"Friends", "Status":"Offline", "Name":"hy6u3" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:29:05Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"c24d2", "Message":"im teling you a ana miner will do wonders you can get lots of merits", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:29:20Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"what rates are you looking at for that?", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:29:39Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"also did they fix the mining-related bugs yet?", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:29:51Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"c24d2", "Message":"i dont know the specifics but its got to be better than pp materials", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:30:12Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"g24r3", "Message":"then I'm not convinced it's worthwhile enough to do because I am a combat pilot", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T14:30:39Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"c24d2", "Message":"i get it but if you want gto make the merits thats the method its not gonna change that fact", "Channel":"squadron" }
