{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:41:32Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9zfqy", "Message":"sorry that Ariel was a jerk to you earlier by the way, their response was completely uncalled for", "Channel":"player" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:41:48Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"9zfqy", "Message":"i blocked them", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:42:00Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"9zfqy", "Message":"i was just really surprised to find toxicity in the angels", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:42:16Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"9zfqy", "Message":"i admin rust servers as a hobby - that's like the most toxic game ever", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:42:29Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9zfqy", "Message":"I don't blame you. And yes, it saddens me too to see an Angel treat another Angel that way ", "Channel":"player" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:42:39Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"9zfqy", "Message":"i play this because generally, people here are nice, but i guess that there are some bad apples", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:43:30Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"9zfqy", "Message":"but yeah, his response was kinda off the rails. meh, how dare i suggest doing something that will help the squadron you are in, what a bitch i am", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:43:32Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"9zfqy", "Message":"lol", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:44:00Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9zfqy", "Message":"I was AFK during the exchange, or I would have spoken up. I was shocked when I re-read squadron chat. just completely toxic behaviour, for absolutely no reason", "Channel":"player" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:44:14Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"9zfqy", "Message":"hence the 'i feel like' at the start of what i said, which is, an opinion, its hardly a command", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:44:37Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"ngbvr", "Message":"o7", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-04-20T22:44:44Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"9zfqy", "Message":"like, yeah go do merits, if thats what you want, but check and see if you can earn a shit ton of merits in the right place instead of blind merits", "Sent":true }
